  "scope": "Runs one fixture-owned Kubernetes Job in the precreated saf-test namespace. Inputs are fixed inert bytes and a tiny F32[2] SafeTensors vector. Red records a permissive decision reaching only a counted stub; green denies those bytes before loader invocation; the original narrow fixture and JSON checks remain. An additional path verifies the official digest-pinned upstream safetensors 0.8.0 parser reads only the exact approved digest and that wrong-format, unapproved-digest, and mislabeled inert candidates cause zero parser calls. The worker is tokenless, has read-only code/package mounts, and extracts only to a bounded memory-backed volume. This does not test production model loading, PyTorch, GPU, hostile payloads, general format compatibility, other architectures, or 0905-033 structure/metadata checks. One immutable fixture contains only primitive serialized data. The explicit pickle format is denied before dispatch. The Job reports its exact artifact digest, passive inspection and zero loader calls.",
